## maistro-core

- This is the **canonical shared library** (`maistro.*`). Keep imports stable for downstream products.
- Follow existing patterns: protocols in `maistro.protocols`, types in `maistro.types`, DI via `maistro.container` where applicable.
- Add or update tests under `packages/maistro-core/tests/` mirroring the module layout.
- For agent behavior changes, check strategies under `maistro/agents/strategies/` and roster under `maistro/agents/`.
